{"type":"data","nodes":[null,{"type":"data","data":[{"card":1,"entry":2,"missions":32,"alongside":33,"kin":34,"engines":59,"usedOn":60,"sites":61,"crewed":65,"museums":66,"hero":67},"https://www.orrerylearn.com/images/cards/fleet/chandra.jpg",{"id":3,"name":4,"category":5,"agency":6,"country":7,"manufacturer":8,"first_flight":9,"status":10,"era":11,"epoch":12,"best_known_for":13,"credit":14,"links":15,"linked_sites":28,"tagline":13,"description":31},"chandra","Chandra X線天文台","observatory","NASA","USA","TRW / Northrop Grumman","1999-07-23","ACTIVE","1981-2011","shuttle-and-mir","空間内で最もシャープなX線イメージ","Skeleton entry for /fleet (PRD-012 v0.2 / Phase A scaffold). Builder + agency + first-flight per public sources. Specs and gallery TBD in later phases.",[16,20,24],{"l":17,"u":18,"t":19},"Chandra X-ray Observatory — Wikipedia","https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chandra_X-ray_Observatory","intro",{"l":21,"u":22,"t":23},"Chandra — NASA","https://chandra.harvard.edu/","core",{"l":25,"u":26,"t":27},"Chandra discoveries archive","https://chandra.harvard.edu/about/","deep",[29],{"type":30,"site_id":3},"earth-object","1999年から運用されているNASAの主力X線天文台。従来のどのX線望遠鏡よりも約25倍高い分解能を持ち、ブラックホールの降着円盤や超新星残骸、銀河団に広がる高温ガスを直接撮像できる。",[],[],[35,39,43,47,51,55],{"id":36,"name":37,"tagline":38},"spitzer","Spitzer宇宙望遠鏡","赤外線グレートオブザーバトリー；16年分のデータ",{"id":40,"name":41,"tagline":42},"compton-gro","Compton Gamma Ray Observatory","NASAの4つの大きな観測所の一つ",{"id":44,"name":45,"tagline":46},"kepler","Kepler","2,700個以上の系外惑星を発見",{"id":48,"name":49,"tagline":50},"tess","TESS","全天系外惑星トランジット探査",{"id":52,"name":53,"tagline":54},"xmm-newton","XMM-Newton","ESAのフラッグシップX線展望台",{"id":56,"name":57,"tagline":58},"hubble","Hubble宇宙望遠鏡","象徴的な可視紫外線宇宙望遠鏡；5回の保守ミッション",[],[],[62],{"type":30,"href":63,"name":4,"place":-1,"text":64},"/earth?id=chandra","NASA の X 線の眼。極めて扁平な楕円軌道で 9,942 km から 133,600 km まで振れる — 月までの距離の約三分の一。放射線帯の外に長く出てクリーンな観測ができる。光学望遠鏡には見えないブラックホール、中性子星、超新星など高エネルギー宇宙を見る。",[],[],"/orrery/images/fleet-galleries/chandra/04.webp"],"uses":{"params":["id"]}}]}
